---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Free Home Buying Guide">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="hero-section">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="hero-text">
        <span class="hero-badge">Free eBook</span>
        <h1>Unlock the Door to <span class="text-gold">Your Dream Home</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">The complete guide to buying a home without the stress, confusion, or surprises. Written by a 20+ year mortgage professional.</p>
        <a href="#download" class="hero-cta">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-5 h-5"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/></svg>
          Download Free Guide
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="book-mockup">
        <div class="book-cover">
          <svg class="book-icon" viewBox="0 0 80 80" fill="none">
            <rect x="15" y="30" width="50" height="35" fill="#4a5568" rx="3"/>
            <rect x="20" y="38" width="15" height="20" fill="#d69e2e"/>
            <rect x="38" y="38" width="8" height="8" fill="#a0aec0"/>
            <rect x="50" y="38" width="8" height="8" fill="#a0aec0"/>
            <polygon points="40,10 15,30 65,30" fill="#2d3748"/>
            <line x1="40" y1="10" x2="40" y2="30" stroke="#d69e2e" stroke-width="2"/>
            <circle cx="62" cy="44" r="6" fill="#d69e2e"/>
            <rect x="60" y="50" width="4" height="10" fill="#d69e2e"/>
          </svg>
          <div class="book-title">Unlock the Door to<br>Your Dream Home</div>
          <div class="book-author">By Dennis Fields</div>
          <div class="book-badge">
            <span>Free</span>
            Guide
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Benefits Section -->
  <section class="benefits-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>What You'll Learn</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">This isn't just another generic home buying guide. It's the insider knowledge I've gained from helping hundreds of families get into homes they love.</p>
      <div class="benefit-grid">
        <div class="benefit-card">
          <h3>Know Your Numbers</h3>
          <p>Discover exactly what you can afford before you start shopping, so you never waste time on homes out of reach.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-card">
          <h3>Get Pre-Approved Right</h3>
          <p>Learn the critical difference between pre-qualification and pre-approval—and why it matters to sellers.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-card">
          <h3>Navigate the Process</h3>
          <p>Follow my 10-step roadmap from "thinking about buying" to "keys in hand" without confusion.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-card">
          <h3>Avoid Costly Mistakes</h3>
          <p>Don't make the common errors that delay closings, kill deals, or cost you thousands of dollars.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-card">
          <h3>Find the Right Loan</h3>
          <p>Understand FHA, VA, USDA, and Conventional loans—and which program fits your situation best.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-card">
          <h3>Work With a Pro</h3>
          <p>Learn what to expect from your mortgage lender and how to make the partnership work for you.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Chapters Section -->
  <section class="chapters-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Inside the Guide</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">Six chapters packed with actionable advice, real-world examples, and the same strategies I share with my clients.</p>
      <ol class="chapter-list">
        <li>
          <div class="chapter-number">1</div>
          <div class="chapter-content">
            <h3>The Home Buying Process: Your Complete Roadmap</h3>
            <p>The 10 steps every buyer needs to follow, from setting your budget to getting your keys.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="chapter-number">2</div>
          <div class="chapter-content">
            <h3>Getting Pre-Approved for a Mortgage</h3>
            <p>What lenders look for, what documents you'll need, and how to strengthen your application.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="chapter-number">3</div>
          <div class="chapter-content">
            <h3>The Mortgage Process Explained</h3>
            <p>Understand the four phases: Pre-Approval, House Hunting, Processing, and Closing.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="chapter-number">4</div>
          <div class="chapter-content">
            <h3>Special Loan Programs You Should Know About</h3>
            <p>FHA, VA, USDA, and Conventional compared—plus down payment assistance options.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="chapter-number">5</div>
          <div class="chapter-content">
            <h3>Common Mistakes That Kill Deals</h3>
            <p>The pitfalls that trip up buyers and how to avoid them before they cost you.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="chapter-number">6</div>
          <div class="chapter-content">
            <h3>Working Together to Get You Home</h3>
            <p>What to expect from your lender and how to make the most of the relationship.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About Section -->
  <section class="about-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-content">
        <div class="author-photo">
          <img src="/dennis-headshot.png" alt="Dennis Fields - Your Local Mortgage Pro">
        </div>
        <div class="author-info">
          <h2>Meet Dennis Fields</h2>
          <p class="author-title">Your Local Mortgage Pro</p>
          <p>With over twenty years in the mortgage industry, I've helped countless families achieve their dream of homeownership. I specialize in finding solutions when others say no—whether you're a first-time buyer, a veteran, or someone rebuilding credit.</p>
          <p>I believe everyone deserves a fair shot at homeownership. That's why I wrote this guide: to share the insider knowledge that makes the difference between a smooth closing and a stressful ordeal.</p>
          <div class="credentials">
            <span class="credential">NMLS #1407951</span>
            <span class="credential">Movement Mortgage</span>
            <span class="credential">NC • SC • VA</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Testimonial -->
  <section class="testimonial-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="quote-mark">"</div>
      <blockquote>Dennis made the whole process so easy. As first-time buyers, we had no idea what to expect, but he walked us through every step. We closed in 30 days and got a payment lower than our rent!</blockquote>
      <p class="testimonial-author">Marcus & Tanya W.</p>
      <p class="testimonial-role">First-Time Homebuyers, Greensboro NC</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Section -->
  <section class="cta-section" id="download">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Ready to Start Your Journey?</h2>
      <p>Get your free copy of the complete home buying guide and take the first step toward your dream home.</p>
      <div class="ghl-form-container">
        <iframe
          src="https://api.leadconnectorhq.com/widget/form/4KorC5oai07iKkaMObDT"
          style="width:100%;height:450px;border:none;border-radius:8px;"
          id="ebook-form-4KorC5oai07iKkaMObDT"
          data-form-name="eBook Download - Unlock the Door"
          data-form-id="4KorC5oai07iKkaMObDT"
          title="eBook Download - Unlock the Door"
        ></iframe>
      </div>
      <p class="cta-note">No spam. Just helpful mortgage insights. Unsubscribe anytime.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script src="https://link.msgsndr.com/js/form_embed.js"></script>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* Variables */
  :root {
    --navy: #1a365d;
    --navy-deep: #0f2442;
    --gold: #d69e2e;
    --gold-light: #f6e089;
  }

  .text-gold {
    color: var(--gold);
  }

  /* Hero Section */
  .hero-section {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy) 0%, var(--navy-deep) 100%);
    color: white;
    padding: 80px 24px 100px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-section::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    background: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='60' height='60' viewBox='0 0 60 60' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cg fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd'%3E%3Cg fill='%23ffffff' fill-opacity='0.03'%3E%3Cpath d='M36 34v-4h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2h-4zm0-30V0h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2V6h4V4h-4zM6 34v-4H4v4H0v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2H6zM6 4V0H4v4H0v2h4v4h2V6h4V4H6z'/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E");
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .hero-content {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 300px;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--gold);
    color: var(--navy);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .hero-section h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    max-width: 500px;
  }

  .hero-cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    background: var(--gold);
    color: var(--navy);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 16px 32px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(214, 158, 46, 0.3);
  }

  .hero-cta:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 28px rgba(214, 158, 46, 0.4);
  }

  /* Book Mockup */
  .book-cover {
    width: 280px;
    height: 380px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--navy) 0%, var(--navy-deep) 60%, var(--gold) 60%, var(--gold) 100%);
    border-radius: 4px 16px 16px 4px;
    box-shadow: -20px 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.3), inset -3px 0 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 40px 24px;
    text-align: center;
    transform: perspective(1000px) rotateY(-8deg);
    position: relative;
  }

  .book-cover::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 20px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.15) 0%, transparent 100%);
    border-radius: 4px 0 0 4px;
  }

  .book-icon {
    width: 80px;
    height: 80px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .book-title {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    margin-top: 25px;
  }

  .book-author {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
  }

  .book-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: -15px;
    right: -15px;
    width: 70px;
    height: 70px;
    background: var(--gold);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--navy);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
  }

  .book-badge span {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  /* Container */
  .container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }

  /* Section Styles */
  section h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .section-intro {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: #4a5568;
    max-width: 650px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  /* Benefits Section */
  .benefits-section {
    background: #f7fafc;
    padding: 80px 24px;
  }

  .benefit-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .benefit-card {
    padding: 32px;
    background: white;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--gold);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
  }

  .benefit-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .benefit-card p {
    color: #4a5568;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Chapters Section */
  .chapters-section {
    background: white;
    padding: 80px 24px;
  }

  .chapter-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .chapter-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 24px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(26, 54, 93, 0.1);
  }

  .chapter-number {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    background: var(--navy);
    color: var(--gold);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .chapter-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .chapter-content p {
    color: #4a5568;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* About Section */
  .about-section {
    background: var(--navy);
    color: white;
    padding: 80px 24px;
  }

  .about-content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 240px 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .author-photo {
    width: 240px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
  }

  .author-photo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .about-section h2 {
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .author-title {
    color: var(--gold-light);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .about-section p {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .credentials {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .credential {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    padding: 10px 18px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--gold-light);
  }

  /* Testimonial Section */
  .testimonial-section {
    background: #f7fafc;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 80px 24px;
  }

  .quote-mark {
    font-size: 4rem;
    color: var(--gold);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  blockquote {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--navy);
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .testimonial-author {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #2d3748;
  }

  .testimonial-role {
    color: #4a5568;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  /* CTA Section */
  .cta-section {
    background: var(--navy);
    text-align: center;
    padding: 100px 24px;
  }

  .cta-section h2 {
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .cta-section > .container > p {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    max-width: 500px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .ghl-form-container {
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .cta-note {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
  }

  /* Mobile Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .hero-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .hero-subtitle {
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }

    .book-mockup {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      order: -1;
    }

    .book-cover {
      width: 220px;
      height: 300px;
      transform: none;
    }

    .about-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .author-photo {
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .credentials {
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>
